                                                                                
 Usage: opentide share push [OPTIONS]                                           
                                                                                
 Create or update one MISP Event per selected Tide object.                      
                                                                                
╭─ Options ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
│ --target                     <str>   Destination block name. Repeatable.     │
│ --uuid                       <str>   Limit to these object UUIDs.            │
│ --type                       <str>   Limit to threat, objective, or rule.    │
│ --file                       <str>   Limit to these object files.            │
│ --dry-run                            Resolve the run locally and make no     │
│                                      request.                                │
│ --publish    --no-publish            Override the block publish flag.        │
│ --workers                    <int>   Parallel object workers for one         │
│                                      destination.                            │
│                                      [default: 1]                            │
│ --changed                            Share only objects the default-branch   │
│                                      CI diff changed.                        │
│ --since                      COMMIT  With --changed: diff from this commit   │
│                                      SHA or ref to HEAD.                     │
│ --help                               Show this message and exit.             │
╰──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯

 Examples
   $ opentide share push --target misp-prod
